+        "shake (no), look_around (slow scan), robot (stiff, jerky), custom, stop. It keeps going while you "
+        "talk, so for a dance pick about as many seconds as your reply takes plus a few (8-15). "
+        "tempo: 100 normal, 150 faster, 70 slower. custom: `steps` = yaw,pitch,ms;yaw,pitch,ms;... as offsets "
+        "in degrees from where you are looking (yaw negative = your left, pitch positive = up), ms until the "
+        "next point (300-500 is lively); up "
